{"asset_key":"ep1/herohub_story_11412070","episode":"ep1","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"11412070","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1141207001:1":{"text":"카이, 페토랑 사이가 정말 좋아 보이는데, 사납지는 않나요?","source_cn":"卡卡，看起来帕托和你相处很好呢，它凶不凶？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x885C89F70972F42F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1141207002:1":{"text":"아니요! 페토는 착한 곰이에요!","source_cn":"帕托！帕托是好熊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA7A975FF25973DCE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1141207003:1":{"text":"처음 만난 페토는 정말 작은 아기 곰이었는데, 지금은 엄청나게 컸어요! 카이보다도 크죠!","source_cn":"卡卡见到帕托的时候，帕托很小一只！现在已经很大了！比卡...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA1C35D5165177C4F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1141207004:1":{"text":"페토가 기분이 안 좋을 땐 털이 바싹 말라버려서 물을 자주 뿌려줘야 하는데...","source_cn":"但是，帕托会不开心，身上的毛，会变干，得经常浇水！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3D1C550BBB5FA9C9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1141207005:1":{"text":"물을 구하기가 쉽지 않아요...","source_cn":"水，很难找……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCA28247D63814929","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:8:1141207005":{"text":"물을 구하기가 쉽지 않아요...","source_cn":"水，很难找……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCA28247D63814929","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1141207006:1":{"text":"네! 그럼요!","source_cn":"一直！都是！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x48868AC022798192","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1141207007:1":{"text":"다들 페토를 무서워해요. 페토도 마찬가지고요! 페토는 카이랑 안탄드라 언니만 좋아해요!","source_cn":"帕托，其他人害怕，帕托也害怕其他人！只喜欢卡卡，还有安...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD771FF834BB46515","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1141207008:1":{"text":"페토는 스톤볼 굴리는 걸 좋아하고, 싸움은 싫어해요. 저녁에 페토한테 기대어 자면 크고 푹신푹신해서 아주 편해요!","source_cn":"但是，帕托喜欢滚石球，不喜欢打架。晚上靠着睡，软软的大...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF4E6E92583304AE9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1141207009:1":{"text":"더 많은 사람이 페토를 좋아했으면 좋겠어요!","source_cn":"帕托，应该被更多人喜欢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0101EA344360C487","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1141207010:1":{"text":"카이, 페토가 좋아하는 바오밥 열매를 구해왔어. 이 정도면 충분하겠지?","source_cn":"我找食物回来了。卡卡，这是帕托喜欢的旅人树果，你看够吃吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x60F6231D59602789","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1141207011:1":{"text":"와아!! 페토! 먹을 게 생겼어!","source_cn":"哇——帕托，有吃的了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8C08AED079605BF7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1141207012:1":{"text":"다 같이 먹을 고기도 있어. 다들 쉬면서 조금씩 나눠 먹자.","source_cn":"还有给大家吃的兽肉，大家休息一下，互相分一分吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA54F7EA53ECA99E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1141207013:1":{"text":"고마워, 언니!","source_cn":"谢谢安丹姐姐！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE0CDAB53361074BC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:8:0:1":{"text":"둘이 항상 같이 있어?","source_cn":"一直都是你和帕托吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xAA08F4981C99BC12","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"둘이 항상 같이 있어?","female":"둘이 항상 같이 있어?","variant_male_record_index":"64334","variant_female_record_index":"64335","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:8:1:2":{"text":"부족 사람들도 페토를 잘 챙겨줘?","source_cn":"部落的人会照顾帕托吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xA33C3840BF8BFC14","var